### ======================================
### 🧪 CARTEIRA DE VACINAÇÃO API - FLUXO DE TESTES VALIDADOS
### ======================================
### 📝 INSTRUÇÕES DE USO:
### 1. Inicie Docker: docker compose up
### 2. Abra este arquivo no VS Code com extensão REST Client
### 3. Execute as requisições em ordem (clique em "Send Request")
### 4. Este arquivo contém APENAS requisições com sucesso esperado (2xx)
### 5. O token de login é capturado AUTOMATICAMENTE!
### ======================================

### Variáveis Globais (ATUALIZE CONFORME NECESSIDADE)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}
@usuarioId = 1
@pessoaId = 1
@alergiaId = 1
@responsavelId = 1

###############################################################################
### 1️⃣ VERIFICAR SAÚDE DA API
###############################################################################
### 📌 O quê: Confirmar que a API está respondendo
### ✅ Resposta esperada: 200 OK
### 📋 Próximo passo: Se falhar, verificar se Docker está rodando
### 🔓 Não requer autenticação
###############################################################################
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json

###############################################################################
### 2️⃣ HOME - INFORMAÇÕES DA API
###############################################################################
### 📌 O quê: Obter informações gerais da API
### ✅ Resposta esperada: 200 OK com versão e endpoints
### 🔓 Não requer autenticação
###############################################################################
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###############################################################################
### 3️⃣ REGISTRAR NOVO USUÁRIO
###############################################################################
### 📌 O quê: Criar novo usuário no sistema
### ✅ Resposta esperada: 201 Created
### 📋 Próximo passo: Copiar "id" para @usuarioId
### ⚠️ Email deve ser ÚNICO em cada teste (mudar o sufixo numérico)
### 🔓 Não requer autenticação
### 📝 Requisitos de Senha:
###    ├─ Mínimo 8 caracteres
###    ├─ 1 letra maiúscula
###    ├─ 1 número
###    └─ 1 caractere especial
###############################################################################
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nomeCompleto": "João Silva Teste",
  "email": "joao.teste@example.com",
  "senha": "Senha@123"
}

###############################################################################
### 4️⃣ LOGIN (OBTER TOKEN JWT)
###############################################################################
### 📌 O quê: Autenticar usuário e obter token de acesso
### ✅ Resposta esperada: 200 OK com token JWT
### 📋 Próximo passo: O token será capturado automaticamente em @token
### 🔓 Não requer autenticação (login é público)
### 💡 IMPORTANTE: Use o mesmo email e senha do PASSO 3
###############################################################################
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao.teste@example.com",
  "senha": "Senha@123"
}

###############################################################################
### 5️⃣ CRIAR PESSOA (COM RESPONSÁVEL AUTOMÁTICO)
###############################################################################
### 📌 O quê: Registrar nova pessoa (pessoas dependentes, filhos, etc)
###    ✨ AUTOMÁTICO: Vínculo de Responsável é criado junto!
### ✅ Resposta esperada: 201 Created
### 📋 Próximo passo: Copiar "id" para @pessoaId
### 🔐 Requer autenticação: Bearer {{token}}
### ⚠️ CNS e CPF devem ser ÚNICOS em cada teste
### 📝 tipoRelacao opções: "Pai", "Mãe", "Responsavel Legal", "Responsavel Familiar"
### 💡 usuario_id será extraído automaticamente do token JWT!
###############################################################################
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pessoas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nomeCompleto": "Maria Silva Filha",
  "dataNascimento": "2015-05-10",
  "cns": "123456789012345",
  "cpf": "12345678901",
  "nomeMae": "Ana Silva",
  "genero": "Feminino",
  "nacionalidade": "Brasileira",
  "naturalidade": "São Paulo",
  "tipoSanguineo": "O+",
  "tipoRelacao": "Pai"
}

###############################################################################
### 6️⃣ LISTAR TODAS AS PESSOAS
###############################################################################
### 📌 O quê: Obter lista completa de todas as pessoas cadastradas
### ✅ Resposta esperada: 200 OK com array de pessoas
### 🔐 Requer autenticação: Bearer {{token}}
###############################################################################
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pessoas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###############################################################################
### 7️⃣ BUSCAR PESSOA POR ID
###############################################################################
### 📌 O quê: Obter detalhes completos de uma pessoa específica
### ✅ Resposta esperada: 200 OK
### 🔐 Requer autenticação: Bearer {{token}}
### 📋 Dependência: Executar Passo 5 primeiro (ter @pessoaId válido)
###############################################################################
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pessoas/{{pessoaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###############################################################################
### 8️⃣ LISTAR TODAS AS ALERGIAS DO CATÁLOGO
###############################################################################
### 📌 O quê: Obter lista completa de todas as alergias disponíveis
### ✅ Resposta esperada: 200 OK com array de alergias
### 💡 Estas alergias podem ser vinculadas à pessoa no Passo 10
### 🔐 Requer autenticação: Bearer {{token}}
###############################################################################
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/alergias
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###############################################################################
### 9️⃣ BUSCAR ALERGIA ESPECÍFICA POR ID
###############################################################################
### 📌 O quê: Obter detalhes de uma alergia específica
### ✅ Resposta esperada: 200 OK
### 🔐 Requer autenticação: Bearer {{token}}
### ⚠️ Mudar {{alergiaId}} para um ID válido (ex: 1, 2, 3...)
###############################################################################
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/alergias/{{alergiaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###############################################################################
### 🔟 VINCULAR ALERGIA À PESSOA (POST SIMPLES)
###############################################################################
### 📌 O quê: Associar uma alergia à pessoa
### ✅ Resposta esperada: 201 Created
### 🔐 Requer autenticação: Bearer {{token}}
### 📋 Dependências:
###    ├─ Executar Passo 5 primeiro (ter @pessoaId)
###    ├─ Executar Passo 8 primeiro (sabendo quais alergias existem)
###    └─ alergiaId deve existir no catálogo
### 📝 observacao é OPCIONAL (pode ser null ou omitido)
###############################################################################
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pessoas/{{pessoaId}}/alergias
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alergiaId": 1,
  "observacao": "Alergia leve, notificação ao responsável"
}

###############################################################################
### 1️⃣1️⃣ LISTAR ALERGIAS DE UMA PESSOA
###############################################################################
### 📌 O quê: Obter todas as alergias vinculadas a uma pessoa específica
### ✅ Resposta esperada: 200 OK com array de alergias vinculadas
### 🔐 Requer autenticação: Bearer {{token}}
### 📋 Dependência: Executar Passo 10 primeiro (ter alergia vinculada)
###############################################################################
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pessoas/{{pessoaId}}/alergias
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###############################################################################
### 1️⃣2️⃣ VINCULAR MÚLTIPLAS ALERGIAS EM LOTE (POST LOTE)
###############################################################################
### 📌 O quê: Associar várias alergias à pessoa em uma única requisição
### ✅ Resposta esperada: 201 Created com array de alergias vinculadas
### 💡 ESPECIAL: Operação é ATÔMICA (ou vincular todas ou falhar)
### 🔐 Requer autenticação: Bearer {{token}}
### 📋 Dependência: Executar Passo 8 primeiro (sabendo quais IDs usar)
### ⚠️ IMPORTANTE: Se qualquer alergia já estiver vinculada, falha tudo
### 📝 Ajustar alergiaIds com valores que NÃO foram vinculados no Passo 10
###############################################################################
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pessoas/{{pessoaId}}/alergias/lote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "alergiaId": 2,
    "observacao": "Alergia moderada"
  },
  {
    "alergiaId": 3,
    "observacao": "Requer medicação específica"
  }
]

###############################################################################
### 1️⃣3️⃣ BUSCAR ALERGIAS POR IDS (LOTE DE CONSULTA)
###############################################################################
### 📌 O quê: Obter dados de múltiplas alergias de uma só vez
### ✅ Resposta esperada: 200 OK com array de alergias
### 🔐 Requer autenticação: Bearer {{token}}
### 📝 Query param "ids" deve ser lista separada por vírgula: ids=1,2,3
###############################################################################
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/alergias/lote?ids=1,2,3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###############################################################################
### 1️⃣4️⃣ ATUALIZAR OBSERVAÇÃO DE ALERGIA
###############################################################################
### 📌 O quê: Modificar apenas o campo observacao do vínculo
### ✅ Resposta esperada: 200 OK
### 🔐 Requer autenticação: Bearer {{token}}
### 📋 Dependência: Executar Passo 10 primeiro (ter alergia vinculada)
### 📝 Apenas "observacao" pode ser atualizada por este endpoint
###############################################################################
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pessoas/{{pessoaId}}/alergias/{{alergiaId}}/observacao
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "observacao": "Alergia atualizada - requer atenção ao vacinar"
}

###############################################################################
### 1️⃣5️⃣ VERIFI CAR RESPONSÁVEIS DO USUÁRIO
###############################################################################
### 📌 O quê: Listar todos os vínculos (responsáveis) do usuário autenticado
### ✅ Resposta esperada: 200 OK com array de responsáveis
### 💡 IMPORTANTE: Responsável criado no Passo 5 aparecerá aqui!
### 🔐 Requer autenticação: Bearer {{token}}
### 📋 Próximo passo: Copiar "id" do primeiro item para @responsavelId
###############################################################################
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/responsaveis/usuario/{{usuarioId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###############################################################################
### 1️⃣6️⃣ BUSCAR RESPONSÁVEL ESPECÍFICO POR ID
###############################################################################
### 📌 O quê: Obter dados detalhados de um responsável
### ✅ Resposta esperada: 200 OK
### 🔐 Requer autenticação: Bearer {{token}}
### 📋 Dependência: Executar Passo 15 para obter @responsavelId válido
###############################################################################
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/responsaveis/{{responsavelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###############################################################################
### 1️⃣7️⃣ ATUALIZAR TIPO DE RELAÇÃO DO RESPONSÁVEL
###############################################################################
### 📌 O quê: Alterar o tipo de relação entre usuário e pessoa
### ✅ Resposta esperada: 200 OK
### 🔐 Requer autenticação: Bearer {{token}}
### 📋 Dependência: Executar Passo 15 para obter @responsavelId válido
### 📝 tipoRelacao opções: "Pai", "Mãe", "Responsavel Legal", "Responsavel Familiar"
###############################################################################
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/responsaveis/{{responsavelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tipoRelacao": "Responsavel Legal"
}

###############################################################################
### 1️⃣8️⃣ ATUALIZAR DADOS DE PESSOA
###############################################################################
### 📌 O quê: Modificar informações cadastrais de uma pessoa
### ✅ Resposta esperada: 200 OK
### 🔐 Requer autenticação: Bearer {{token}}
### 📋 Dependência: Executar Passo 5 primeiro (ter @pessoaId válido)
### 📝 Todos os campos devem ser preenchidos (mesmo que sem mudanças)
### ⚠️ CNS e CPF não podem ser alterados para valores já existentes
###############################################################################
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/pessoas/{{pessoaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nomeCompleto": "Maria Silva Filha - Atualizado",
  "dataNascimento": "2015-05-10",
  "cns": "123456789012345",
  "cpf": "12345678901",
  "nomeMae": "Ana Silva",
  "genero": "Feminino",
  "nacionalidade": "Brasileira",
  "naturalidade": "São Paulo",
  "tipoSanguineo": "O+",
  "tipoRelacao": "Pai"
}

###############################################################################
### 1️⃣9️⃣ LIMPAR OBSERVAÇÃO DE ALERGIA (SEM DELETAR VÍNCULO)
###############################################################################
### 📌 O quê: Remover apenas o texto da observacao, mantendo alergia vinculada
### ✅ Resposta esperada: 204 No Content
### 🔐 Requer autenticação: Bearer {{token}}
### 📋 Dependência: Executar Passo 10 primeiro (ter alergia com observacao)
### 💡 Diferente do Passo 20: aqui NÃO desvincula a alergia
###############################################################################
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pessoas/{{pessoaId}}/alergias/{{alergiaId}}/observacao
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###############################################################################
### 2️⃣0️⃣ DELETAR VÍNCULO DE ALERGIA (REMOVE COMPLETAMENTE)
###############################################################################
### 📌 O quê: Remover completamente a alergia da pessoa
### ✅ Resposta esperada: 204 No Content
### 🔐 Requer autenticação: Bearer {{token}}
### 📋 Dependência: Ter uma alergia vinculada que você quer remover
### ⚠️ AVISO: Esta ação é IRREVERSÍVEL
### 💡 Diferente do Passo 19: aqui DESVINCULA completamente a alergia
### 📝 Use um alergiaId que foi vinculado (ex: 2 ou 3 do Passo 12)
###############################################################################
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pessoas/{{pessoaId}}/alergias/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###############################################################################
### 2️⃣1️⃣ DELETAR VÍNCULO DE RESPONSÁVEL
###############################################################################
### 📌 O quê: Desvincular um responsável (remover o vínculo usuário-pessoa)
### ✅ Resposta esperada: 204 No Content
### 🔐 Requer autenticação: Bearer {{token}}
### 📋 Dependência: Ter um @responsavelId válido
### ⚠️ AVISO: Esta ação é IRREVERSÍVEL
###############################################################################
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/responsaveis/{{responsavelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###############################################################################
### 2️⃣2️⃣ DELETAR PESSOA
###############################################################################
### 📌 O quê: Remover pessoa do sistema
### ✅ Resposta esperada: 204 No Content
### 🔐 Requer autenticação: Bearer {{token}}
### 📋 Dependência: Ter uma @pessoaId válida
### ⚠️ AVISO: Esta ação é IRREVERSÍVEL
### 💡 Responsáveis vinculados devem ser deletados ANTES (Passo 21)
### 💡 Alergias podem ser deletadas antes ou o sistema cuida automaticamente
###############################################################################
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/pessoas/{{pessoaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###############################################################################
### 2️⃣3️⃣ LISTAR TODOS OS USUÁRIOS (ADMIN)
###############################################################################
### 📌 O quê: Obter lista completa de todos os usuários do sistema
### ✅ Resposta esperada: 200 OK com array de usuários
### 🔐 Requer autenticação: Bearer {{token}}
### 📋 Dependência: Executar Passo 3 primeiro (ter usuario criado)
### 💡 Este endpoint pode estar reservado para ADMIN no futuro
###############################################################################
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###############################################################################
### 2️⃣4️⃣ BUSCAR USUÁRIO ESPECÍFICO POR ID
###############################################################################
### 📌 O quê: Obter informações de um usuário específico
### ✅ Resposta esperada: 200 OK
### 🔐 Requer autenticação: Bearer {{token}}
### 📋 Dependência: Ter um @usuarioId válido
### ⚠️ NOTA: Password NUNCA é retornada na resposta (segurança)
###############################################################################
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios/{{usuarioId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
